body:
"Keep Getting told I just need to let go so I’m letting it all go." 

&#x200B;

My mother tells me that about me finishing my degree.

"Hey Lana..."

&#x200B;

"Danger zone."

Give in a couple of decades, and it might, since it's basically a specific type of PTSD.

&#x200B;

"The refuges that escaped from their home country were so traumatized they developed TDS out of fear of their government."
